	<string name="pref_about">About</string>
	<string name="pref_about_description">
"TypeDuck Mandarin is an independent Traditional Chinese Mandarin Pinyin adaptation of the open-source TypeDuck Android keyboard.

The keyboard uses the Rime input method engine and a pinned CC-CEDICT-derived Traditional Chinese lexicon. Dictionary provenance and licensing are documented in MANDARIN_DICTIONARY.md in the source repository.

Upstream TypeDuck was developed by the Department of Linguistics and Modern Language Studies, The Education University of Hong Kong. This fork is not an official TypeDuck-HK release."
	</string>
